ull,\"state\":\"needs_exegesis\",\"twitter_share_message\":\"“?” —@Genius\",\"url\":\"https://genius.com/41111372/Coasters-zaf-u-wanna/U-wanna\",\"verified\":false,\"votes_total\":0,\"current_user_metadata\":{\"permissions\":[\"edit\",\"report_as_abusive\"],\"excluded_permissions\":[\"vote\",\"cosign\",\"uncosign\",\"destroy\",\"accept\",\"reject\",\"see_unreviewed\",\"clear_votes\",\"propose_edit_to\",\"pin_to_profile\",\"unpin_from_profile\",\"update_source\",\"edit_custom_preview\",\"create_comment\"],\"interactions\":{\"cosign\":false,\"pyong\":false,\"vote\":null},\"iq_by_action\":{\"accept\":{\"primary\":{\"multiplier\":1,\"base\":10.0,\"applicable\":true}},\"reject\":{\"primary\":{\"multiplier\":1,\"base\":2.0,\"applicable\":true}},\"delete\":{\"primary\":{\"multiplier\":1,\"base\":5.0,\"applicable\":false}}}},\"accepted_by\":null,\"authors\":[{\"_type\":\"user_attribution\",\"attribution\":1.0,\"pinned_role\":null,\"user\":{\"_type\":\"user\",\"about_me_summary\":\"HE’S BACKKKKKKK\\n✦ achievements here ✦\\n\\n  \\n\\n\\nI’m on a mission; don’t distract me.\\nOne RRR, one day! You can join too, here. (so much for staying consistent)\\n\\n3,000 IQ – May 24, 2025\\n4,000 IQ – August 1, 2025\\n5,000 IQ – August 29, 2025 (1000 IQ in one month is crazy! – for me)\\n6,000 IQ – September 7, 2025 (I’m on crack)\\n\\nWas granted the transcriber role between these dates.\\n\\n7,000 IQ – September 13, 2025 (Dedication)\\n8,000 IQ – September 26, 2025 (I gotta do my job, ya know)\\n9,000 IQ – October 4, 2025 (Power!)\\n13,000 IQ – October 5, 2025 (Some may say I was high on meth for this kind of leap, lol)\\nFUN FACT: I also reached Top 3 on the leaderboard today :)\\n15,000 IQ – I don’t even know when I reached 15k, but it should be around November 1, 2025.\\n16,000 IQ – November 7, 2025\\n18,000 IQ – November 8, 2025\\n19,000 IQ – November 9, 2025\\n22,000 IQ – November 10, 2025\\n(Haven’t been keeping track, damn)\\n27,000 IQ – November 15, 2025 – All Hail the Scribe 